Comment ( openRTS's own bulk cargo kinds (docs/cargo.md). RTS's own are built into rts1.exe; these add to them.
          Density: kg/m3 of the cargo heaped (testers' figures). Pile: its heap's shape, 0 flat .. 1 steep.
          Texture: GLOBAL/TEXTURES/<Texture>1.ace, else <Texture>.ace (as RTS's RTSCargo_<cargo>1.ace). )

